==Trivia==
*He has the weakest [[Barrier]] in the game, to the point where even the default [[Cat Cannon]] can destroy it.
*His English name is a reference to the Weyland Corporation which appears in the ''[[wikipedia:Alien (franchise)|Alien]]'' franchise.
*His Japanese name, Captain Moguu, is a combination of two of the readings of the word 土竜 (meaning "mole"): ''mogura'' and ''doryū/doryuu''.
*Without the star symbol, his helmet would essentially be a white version of Captain Ultra's helmet from the tokusatsu series ''[[wikipedia:Captain Ultra (TV series)|Captain Ultra]]'', which is also alluded to by his "safeguarding love and peace throughout the cosmos" and the "Captain" in his Japanese name.
*Since Mr. Mole references ''[[wikipedia:Street Fighter|Street Fighter]]'', the "Iron Fist of Justice" (正義の鉄拳 ''Seigi no Tekken'') in Corporal Weyland's Japanese description might reference ''[[wikipedia:Tekken|Tekken]]'' (鉄拳, "Iron Fist"), another fighting game series.
*The undercover investigation in his Japanese description may allude to one of the other meanings of the word ''mole'': a double agent.
*As it says in his Japanese description, his attack comes with a warning: the emergency light on his helmet turns on right before he goes underground.

